# Step 2: Architecture («Архитектура»); epic also split («Разбиение»)
Map only intents that step 1 justified. Add no field, screen, or block that step 1 omitted. Do not redesign product layout. Send an unresolved how to step 3.

Refuse feature «Архитектура» until that feature's step 1 meets the refuse bar in `playbook-step-01-analysis.mdc`. Epic «Бизнес и сценарии» alone never unlocks feature code.

- Epic (route stages 2-3): services, boundaries, integration options, and why the option was chosen. Then «Разбиение» into Features (wiki page + issue, GitHub sub-issues of the epic). No field catalog and no screen layout. Not a buildable screen TZ. Children of the epic are features or bugs.
- Feature (route stage 2): map each justified information need and layout choice to model fields, API (method, path, access, body, response, errors), contracts, migrations, and impact. Do not open a child issue of another type. A slice that needs its own product analysis is another Feature under the same epic.
- Bug or tiny fix: no architecture section and no new fields. It implements the issue criteria (`playbook-step-05-development.mdc`).
- Business part unclear: do not rewrite it; options to «Решения», hand back.
- Every important choice = one «Решения» row. An impactful «how we do it» choice that is not already in the authorized task goes to the owner via the lead (step 3). Once that decision is recorded, or the owner already put this task in work, a matching PR does not need a second yes at merge (`00-core.mdc`).
